Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:38:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Desktop poll cost: move the annotation revalidation
 and origin-work snapshot into topical siblings

kanban_session_activity stays under its line cap: the unchanged-input revalidation lives in
kanban_session_activity_revalidate, the origin-work snapshot in kanban_session_activity_origin_snapshot (re-exported
as _remote_snapshot, so its test seams stay). gateway.py nets zero lines.
